00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:35.220
<b>Kouda</b>

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:35.220
<i>Field change for Oobi Middle.</i>

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:35.510
<b>Mayumura</b>

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.180
<b>Mayumura</b>

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:43.150
<i>Second base Mayumura-san is taking
over from pitcher Idemitsu-kun.</i>

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:47.890
<i>Idemitsu-kun moves to second base.</i>

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:49.030
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:49.030
<b>Mayumura Michiru</b>

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.070
M-Michiru-chan?!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:55.030
Could you be Shigeno Daigo-kun?

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:58.640
U-Uh, yeah, I am.

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:01.860
I-It's so nice to meet you!

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:06.210
My name's Mayumura Michiru,
and I'm Touto Boys' pitcher!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:11.010
The pitching style I've adored the most...

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:18.130
...is the left-handed overhead 
Shigeno Goro throws!

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:25.850
Mayumura? Does that mean she's the
girl half of Touto Boys' Mayumura twins?

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:31.300
Can't be. I heard the Mayumura
twins joined Yokohama Senior.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:37.660
Strike! Out!

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:41.310
Hey, why don't we take a seat?

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:42.680
R-Right...

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:47.360
<i>Bottom of the sixth, Oobi Middle to bat.</i>

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.550
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.550
<b>Idemitsu</b>

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:50.550
<i>Batting first, second base, Idemitsu-kun.</i>

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:50.550
Bring it!

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:57.470
<i>I didn't expect us to have such
a tough game in the prelims.</i>

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:06.720
<i>Batting second, pitcher, Mayumura-san.</i>

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:09.940
First!

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:12.650
Out!

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:16.110
<i>Batting third, shortstop, Seko-kun.</i>

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:16.110
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:16.110
<b>Seko</b>

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:19.880
<i>The top of their order are using
this pattern to score again.</i>

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.540
<i>Jitou, hang in there!</i>

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.750
Yeah, nice!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:30.710
<i>Batting fourth, catcher, Uozumi-kun.</i>

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:32.490
<i>This is ridiculous.</i>

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:35.420
<i>They're swinging at my
pitches like they're nothing.</i>

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:37.380
<i>Who the hell...</i>

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.220
<i>...are these guys?!</i>

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.120
Strike! You're out!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.030
That's game!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.930
What the heck is this team?

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:08.290
<b>Eihou Academy</b>

